<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Lochlan Werdell | Outdoor Athlete & Adventure Creator</title>

<style>

/* =========================
   RESET
========================= */

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  background: #f4f4f4;
  color: #222;
  line-height: 1.7;
}


/* =========================
   NAVIGATION
========================= */

nav {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 16px 20px;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  text-align: center;
  z-index: 1000;
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
}

nav a {
  display: inline-block;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin: 0 15px;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: #7CFC00;
}


/* =========================
   HERO
========================= */

header {
  min-height: 100vh;
  background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.35), rgba(0,0,0,.45)),
    url("IMG_3809.JPG") center center / cover no-repeat;

  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  color: white;
  padding: 100px 20px 40px;
}

.hero {
  background: rgba(0,0,0,.55);
  padding: 45px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  max-width: 750px;
  width: 100%;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 64px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.button {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 14px 30px;
  background: #2E8B57;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: bold;
  transition: .3s;
}

.button:hover {
  background: #246B43;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}


/* =========================
   SECTIONS
========================= */

section {
  padding: 80px 7%;
}

.card {
  background: white;
  padding: 45px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.10);
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: auto;
}

h2 {
  font-size: 42px;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  color: #1c1c1c;
}

.about p {
  font-size: 20px;
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: auto;
  text-align: center;
}


/* =========================
   GALLERY
========================= */

.gallery-intro {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 19px;
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: 0 auto 35px;
}

.photos {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 30px;
}

.photos img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 280px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 15px;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}


/* =========================
   TEXT SECTIONS
========================= */

.text-section {
  text-align: center;
}

.text-section p {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: auto;
  font-size: 20px;
}


/* =========================
   FOOTER
========================= */

footer {
  background: #111;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px 20px;
}

footer p {
  font-size: 14px;
}


/* =========================
   MOBILE
========================= */

@media (max-width: 768px) {

  nav {
    padding: 12px 10px;
  }

  nav a {
    margin: 0 7px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  header {
    min-height: 90vh;
    padding-top: 100px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 30px 20px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 42px;
  }

  .hero p {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  section {
    padding: 55px 15px;
  }

  .card {
    padding: 25px 18px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
  }

  .about p,
  .text-section p {
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .photos {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .photos img {
    height: 260px;
  }

}

</style>
</head>


<body>


<!-- =========================
     NAVIGATION
========================= -->

<nav>

  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>

</nav>


<!-- =========================
     HERO
========================= -->

<header>

  <div class="hero">

    <h1>Lochlan Werdell</h1>

    <p>
      Outdoor Athlete • Adventure Creator • Mountain Biker • Mountaineer
    </p>

    <a href="#about" class="button">
      Explore My Adventures
    </a>

  </div>

</header>


<!-- =========================
     ABOUT
========================= -->

<section id="about">

  <div class="card about">

    <h2>About Me</h2>

    <p>
      From a young age, the outdoors has been where I feel most at home.
      Whether I'm mountaineering, mountain biking, hiking, or backpacking,
      I'm always looking for opportunities to challenge myself and experience
      new places. My goal is to inspire others through authentic outdoor
      content while building meaningful partnerships with brands that value
      adventure, exploration, and the outdoors.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     ADVENTURE GALLERY
========================= -->

<section id="gallery">

  <div class="card">

    <h2>Adventure Gallery</h2>

    <p class="gallery-intro">
      Every adventure tells a story. These moments represent my passion for
      exploring the outdoors through mountaineering, mountain biking, hiking,
      backpacking, and photography.
    </p>


    <div class="photos">

      <img src="IMG_3809.JPG" alt="Mountain Summit">

      <img src="IMG_0021.JPG" alt="Glacier Travel">

      <img src="IMG_0019.jpg" alt="Camping">

      <img src="IMG_0028.jpeg" alt="Mountain Adventure">

      <img src="IMG_3881.jpeg" alt="Backpacking">

      <img src="ABA22BDA-BDF8-4013-871C-1A4327213117.jpeg"
           alt="Mountain Biking">

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     MOUNTAIN BIKING
========================= -->

<section class="text-section">

  <div class="card">

    <h2>Mountain Biking</h2>

    <p>
      Mountain biking pushes me to improve every ride while exploring
      incredible trails and landscapes. Whether racing, riding with friends,
      or discovering new terrain, every ride strengthens my passion for
      adventure and the outdoors.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     MOUNTAINEERING
========================= -->

<section class="text-section">

  <div class="card">

    <h2>Mountaineering</h2>

    <p>
      Reaching mountain summits requires preparation, perseverance, and
      teamwork. Mountaineering has become one of my greatest passions because
      every climb teaches new skills while rewarding me with unforgettable
      experiences.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     BACKPACKING
========================= -->

<section class="text-section">

  <div class="card">

    <h2>Backpacking & Camping</h2>

    <p>
      Whether spending nights in the backcountry or relaxing after a long
      hike, backpacking allows me to disconnect from everyday life and
      reconnect with nature.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     CONTACT
========================= -->

<section id="contact">

  <div class="card text-section">

    <h2>Let's Work Together</h2>

    <p>
      I'm always interested in partnering with brands that share a passion
      for adventure, outdoor recreation, and authentic storytelling.
      If you're looking for engaging content, product reviews, photography,
      or long-term ambassador opportunities, I'd love to connect.
    </p>

    <br>

    <a
      href="mailto:loch.werdell@gmail.com"
      class="button">
      Contact Me
    </a>

    <br><br>

    <a
      href="https://www.instagram.com/loch_powmotion/"
      class="button"
      target="_blank">
      Follow @loch_powmotion
    </a>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     FOOTER
========================= -->

<footer>

  <p>
    © 2026 Lochlan Werdell. All rights reserved.
  </p>

</footer>


</body>
</html>
